        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Mark Owen, Gary Barlow, Robbie Williams, Howard Donald, Jason Orange\n- Groups: Take That\n- Products: “Four Minute Warning”, In Your Own Time\n- Roles: lead singer, primary songwriter, backing vocals, dancers\n\nFacts:\n- “Four Minute Warning” is the first single released from Mark Owen’s second solo studio album, In Your Own Time.\n- The single “Four Minute Warning” was released on 4 August 2003.\n- Gary Barlow acts as Take That’s lead singer and primary songwriter.\n- In Take That, Mark Owen and Robbie Williams initially provided backing vocals, while Howard Donald and Jason Orange primarily served as dancers.\n- In Take That, Mark Owen and Howard Donald now act as backing vocals.",
